tool.gradient.description = Dosa ukuzalisa ileya -- udlule kokukhethiweko nakukhona -- ngokutjhuguluka kombala okunqophileko okusuka kumbala wangaphambili kuye kumbala wangemuva ngendlela yokudosa.
